<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="scenario_2_table_with_caption_element" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 2 — Table with &lt;caption&gt; element</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d725e7">
         <p>Consider a configuration parameter table with and a caption style exists immediately above the table.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table with caption element</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>.docx Style / Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>[Caption]:</b> Server Configuration Parameters   <b>[Header Row]:</b> Parameter | Default Value | Description   <b>[Row]:</b> Port | 8080 | Server listening port  <b>[Row]:</b> Timeout | 60 | Session timeout value in seconds  <b>[Row]:</b> Enable SSL | True | Enables encrypted communication</entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_lfy_5jy_kkc">
&lt;reference id="server_configuration_parameters">
  &lt;title>Server Configuration Parameters&lt;/title>
  &lt;refbody>
    &lt;table>
      &lt;title>Server Configuration Parameters&lt;/title>
      &lt;tgroup cols="3">
        &lt;colspec colname="c1"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c2"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c3"/>
        &lt;thead>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Parameter&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Default Value&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Description&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/thead>
        &lt;tbody>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Port&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>8080&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Server listening port&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Timeout&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>60&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Session timeout value in seconds&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Enable SSL&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>True&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Enables encrypted communication&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/tbody>
      &lt;/tgroup>
    &lt;/table>
  &lt;/refbody>
&lt;/reference></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter uses a CALS table (<codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph>+ <codeph>&lt;tgroup&gt;</codeph>) when:</p>
         <ul id="ul_072335">
            <li>Merged cells exist</li>
            <li>Row or column spans exist</li>
            <li>Caption exists</li>
         </ul>
         <p>This table structure provides greater flexibility than <codeph>&lt;simpletable&gt;</codeph> and supports more complex layouts.</p>
         <note type="note"> Always use Insert -&gt; Caption to add captions. Only paragraphs with
            the Caption style applied are mapped to <codeph>&lt;title&gt;</codeph> elements. Normal
            or manually added caption title are mapped to <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> tag.</note>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>